# 2. The target architecture I recommend

I would use this model:

```text
                         ┌─────────────────────┐
                         │      ELECTION       │
                         │                     │
                         │  Voter Admission    │
                         │     Policy          │
                         └──────────┬──────────┘
                                    │
                         defines required gates
                                    │
                                    ▼
                         ┌─────────────────────┐
                         │   VOTER REGISTRY    │
                         │                     │
                         │ ElectionMembership  │
                         │                     │
                         │ "registered voter"  │
                         └──────────┬──────────┘
                                    │
                              must satisfy
                                    │
                                    ▼
                         ┌─────────────────────┐
                         │   ADMISSION GATES  │
                         │                     │
                         │ Identity verified   │
                         │ Manual approval     │
                         │ ...                 │
                         └──────────┬──────────┘
                                    │
                              all required
                                  gates
                                  PASS
                                    │
                                    ▼
                         ┌─────────────────────┐
                         │ VOTING ENTITLEMENT  │
                         │                     │
                         │    CanCastVote      │
                         └──────────┬──────────┘
                                    │
                                    ▼
                                  VOTE
```

This gives us a very important DDD separation:

> **ElectionMembership tells us that the person is registered.  
> Admission evidence tells us that the person has passed the required gates.  
> VotingEntitlement determines whether the person can actually vote.**

