# 8. Separate Admission from Exercisability

This distinction is particularly important for an online election.

Suppose:

```text
Alice
✓ imported
✓ verified
✓ approved
✓ eligible
```

She is **admitted**.

But the election is currently:

```text
SETUP_ADMINISTRATION
```

Therefore:

```text
Alice = admitted
Alice = cannot vote NOW
```

Later:

```text
VotingActive
```

then:

```text
Alice = admitted
Alice = exercisable
```

So:

```text
ADMISSION
    ≠
EXERCISABILITY
```

This will prevent many future architectural problems.

