# 15. Existing voters when the gate is introduced

This is a very important requirements issue.

Suppose:

```text
5 voters imported
```

and then the election administrator selects:

```text
Officer verification required
```

What happens?

I agree with the investigation:

```text
5 registered
0 admitted
```

until verification.

Otherwise:

```text
import before rule
      =
implicit verification
```

which defeats the purpose.

But I would make this an explicit product decision because it has operational consequences.

The report identifies exactly this issue for `onf-2`: switching the requirement on would leave all five existing voters unadmitted until verified. Eingefügter Text

