# 16. Gate evidence should be protocol-grade

For an online election, this is more important than in an ordinary CRUD application.

We should be able to answer later:

> Who admitted this voter, when, under which election rule, and based on what evidence?

Therefore:

```text
VoterVerification
-----------------
election_id
voter_id
verified_by
verified_at
status
evidence
```

And protocol:

```text
VOTER_ADMISSION_VERIFIED
VOTER_ADMISSION_REVOKED
```

with:

```text
subject_voter_id
acting_officer_id
election_id
timestamp
```

The investigation already identifies a weakness: the current audit records the officer but not the subject voter. Eingefügter Text

That should be corrected when this becomes an actual admission gate.

