### And the domain vocabulary becomes:

| Concept | Meaning |
|---|---|
| **Voter Registration** | Person is registered for this election |
| **Voter Admission** | Person has passed required gates |
| **Admission Requirement** | What this election requires before admission |
| **Admission Evidence** | Evidence that a gate was passed |
| **Voting Entitlement** | Current right to cast a ballot |
| **Exercisability** | Whether that right can be exercised now |
| **Election Constitution** | Constitutional election rules |
